# Build-context filter for the E2E runner image (Dockerfile.e2e).
#
# The image only needs custom_components/, scripts/e2e_bootstrap.py,
# tests_e2e/, examples/ and requirements_e2e.txt. Everything else is either
# irrelevant for the container or must not end up in an image layer at all
# (submodule trees, local agent state, credentials/tokens in .env-like files).
# examples/ is included on purpose: examples/dashboard-labs-card.yaml is the
# artifact under test for REQ-HOM-126, not documentation.
.agent-meta/
.agents/
.claude/
.gemini/
.opencode/
.meta-config/
.git/
.github/
docs/
tests/
external/
test-results/
docker/ha_config_e2e/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.md
sync.log
